      "body": {
        "prompt": "<p><strong>Read. Then, complete the sentence.</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What in the World?&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Thanks to globalisation, supermarkets in nearly every country offer foods from all over the world. While this allows consumers to enjoy a greater variety, it also contributes to a shift in eating habits. The benefit of this change is that more people can experience different cuisines and nutrients.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">However, it has also led to the extinction or endangerment of traditional plants and animals, as livestock and crops are grown mostly to serve global demand.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For example, processed foods have become common in many countries, sometimes replacing fresh, local dishes. This shift can create new obstacles, such as health issues related to nutrition, and raises questions about how global trade affects local cultures.</span></p>\n<p><strong><br /></strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> The decline of traditional plants and animals is connected to &nbsp;<blank-field id=\"649\" class=\"mceNonEditable\"></blank-field>&nbsp;.</span></p>",
